{"posts":[{"id":"finddecision_p3_51","t":"Here is my work on decision points.\n\nIt was drilling for decision points from AUDUSD D1 chart.\n\nOne thing I discovered is that I maximum had to drill down to H1 to get the cause for price to change its direction.\n\nAll comments are welcome:::","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:16","r":"Master Trader","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe"],"fa":"این هم کار من روی نقطه‌های تصمیم.\n\nداشتم روی چارت D1 مربوط به AUDUSD برای نقطه‌های تصمیم حفاری می‌کردم.\n\nچیزی که کشف کردم این بود که حداکثر تا H1 باید پایین می‌رفتم تا دلیل تغییر جهت قیمت رو پیدا کنم.\n\nاز همهٔ کامنت‌ها استقبال می‌کنم:::","ib":{"fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe":4},"m":51},{"id":"finddecision_p3_52","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:17","r":"Master Trader","n":"#52","p":3,"im":["1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1"],"ib":{"1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1":0},"m":52},{"id":"finddecision_p3_53","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:17","r":"Master Trader","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5"],"ib":{"c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5":0},"m":53},{"id":"finddecision_p3_54","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:18","r":"Master Trader","n":"#54","p":3,"im":["88099fb585331f4dabaef865e8ebd61cf1c66315"],"ib":{"88099fb585331f4dabaef865e8ebd61cf1c66315":0},"m":54},{"id":"finddecision_p3_55","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:18","r":"Master Trader","n":"#55","p":3,"im":["ffda0ba2d9462f39bc41ade32496e820c445e424"],"ib":{"ffda0ba2d9462f39bc41ade32496e820c445e424":0},"m":55},{"id":"finddecision_p3_56","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:18","r":"Master Trader","n":"#56","p":3,"im":["30aca859c960a00de074a64869ff483dc371e284"],"ib":{"30aca859c960a00de074a64869ff483dc371e284":0},"m":56},{"id":"finddecision_p3_57","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:19","r":"Master Trader","n":"#57","p":3,"im":["51be2f0568d57054cdf79e4b48771838d006687c"],"ib":{"51be2f0568d57054cdf79e4b48771838d006687c":0},"m":57},{"id":"finddecision_p3_58","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:19","r":"Master Trader","n":"#58","p":3,"im":["67430c61c02ea1fedafaa13dc4d93c9084a48819"],"ib":{"67430c61c02ea1fedafaa13dc4d93c9084a48819":0},"m":58},{"id":"finddecision_p3_59","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:20","r":"Master Trader","n":"#59","p":3,"im":["58d77262c0e6ff646a23f0474c4bffac1678591e"],"ib":{"58d77262c0e6ff646a23f0474c4bffac1678591e":0},"m":59},{"id":"finddecision_p3_60","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:20","r":"Master Trader","n":"#60","p":3,"im":["d420a80be3f0401880558f858e609f6589c908bf"],"ib":{"d420a80be3f0401880558f858e609f6589c908bf":0},"m":60},{"id":"finddecision_p3_61","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"28 Aug 2012 19:20","r":"Master Trader","n":"#61","p":3,"im":["17e4e4be16050bb4c3eb1ea3ee88ca21c8e78b66"],"ib":{"17e4e4be16050bb4c3eb1ea3ee88ca21c8e78b66":0},"m":61},{"id":"finddecision_p3_62","t":"This will be alot like the Read a Session Homework, except that I want you to do learn from it how to pinpoint in advance, turns in the market which will pay you very large rewards for minimal risk.\n\nSo Open a D1 chart on any pair Download as much LTF history as you can for it Start at the second price turn on the left Look to the left of it, in the lowest TF you can Work out why price reacted to that level Mark the reason on the LTF chart Take a little screenshot of that area - name it \"name of pair\"1 Mark the turning point on D1 with a 1 Move on to the next turning point, and repeat, and then the next. Do this for every turning point. When you're finished, you'll have a D1 chart with all the turning points numbered, and a gallery of thumbnails of the LTFs, each explaining the turns.\n\nDo this for as many pairs as you possibly can\n\nBelieve me, it'll be well worth it!","a":"Nosbigs","d":"16 Sep 2012 12:06","r":"","n":"#62","p":3,"im":[],"fa":"این خیلی شبیه تمرین «خواندن یک جلسه» است، با این تفاوت که می‌خواهم از آن یاد بگیرید چطور از قبل نقاط چرخش بازار را مشخص کنید؛ چرخش‌هایی که با کمترین ریسک، پاداش خیلی زیادی به شما می‌دهند.\n\nپس روی هر جفتی یک چارت D1 باز کنید، تا جایی که می‌توانید تاریخچهٔ LTF آن را دانلود کنید، از دومین چرخش قیمت در سمت چپ شروع کنید، به سمت چپش نگاه کنید، در پایین‌ترین TF ممکن، دلیل واکنش قیمت به آن سطح را پیدا کنید، دلیل را روی چارت LTF علامت بزنید، از آن ناحیه یک عکس از صفحه کوچک بگیرید و اسمش را «نام جفت»1 بگذارید، نقطهٔ چرخش را روی D1 با 1 علامت بزنید، بروید سراغ نقطهٔ چرخش بعدی و همین کار را تکرار کنید، و بعد بعدی. این کار را برای هر نقطهٔ چرخش انجام دهید. وقتی تمام شد، یک چارت D1 دارید که همهٔ نقاط چرخش رویش شماره خورده‌اند و یک گالری از تصاویر کوچک LTF‌ها که هر کدام آن چرخش‌ها را توضیح می‌دهد.\n\nاین کار را برای هر جفتی که می‌توانید انجام دهید\n\nباور کنید، خیلی ارزشش را دارد! 1 Mark","m":62},{"id":"finddecision_p3_63","t":"Hello guys\n\nHere is EURUSD daily chart. I’m trying to find out why price reacted to marked levels. Feel free comment on my charts.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"08 Oct 2012 12:01","r":"Trader","n":"#63","p":3,"im":["99a4372da52df2d59f0fe72d550f21f4080f7a17"],"fa":"سلام بچه‌ها\n\nاین چارت روزانهٔ EURUSD است. دارم سعی می‌کنم بفهمم چرا قیمت به سطوح علامت‌خورده واکنش نشون داده. راحت روی چارت‌هام کامنت بذارید.\n\nبا احترام، Ashkan","ib":{"99a4372da52df2d59f0fe72d550f21f4080f7a17":3},"m":63},{"id":"finddecision_p3_64","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"08 Oct 2012 12:04","r":"Trader","n":"#64","p":3,"im":["c02e67a99b1d9f5517fcbff9f4a92d563cb563c6"],"ib":{"c02e67a99b1d9f5517fcbff9f4a92d563cb563c6":0},"m":64},{"id":"finddecision_p3_65","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"08 Oct 2012 12:12","r":"Trader","n":"#65","p":3,"im":["db200a40791cb4b4deaa71fd15a74b69f139e1ef"],"ib":{"db200a40791cb4b4deaa71fd15a74b69f139e1ef":0},"m":65},{"id":"finddecision_p3_66","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"08 Oct 2012 12:13","r":"Trader","n":"#66","p":3,"im":["6cb50234d599b8ff96f312717fb70a3858292b88"],"ib":{"6cb50234d599b8ff96f312717fb70a3858292b88":0},"m":66},{"id":"finddecision_p3_67","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d"