ion point that caused the swing high you labelled '1' to go into a sell off.:)","a":"naughtypip","d":"15 Oct 2012 22:45","r":"Trader","n":"#74","p":3,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Alex،\n\nحتماً گذشته رو چک کن و نقطهٔ تصمیمی رو پیدا کن که باعث شد اون سقف سوئینگی که با «1» علامت زدی بره تو یه موج فروش.:)","m":74},{"id":"finddecision_p3_75","t":"Hi naughtypip, I marked the daily with the horizontal dotted line which was a wkly close. Price couldn't close above the BRN high. Lower high marked @ 1.2990 was decision point to drop. Thanks.\n\n...\n\nFind the","a":"AlexC","d":"15 Oct 2012 22:55","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#75","p":3,"im":[],"fa":"سلام naughtypip، چارت روزانه رو با یک خط افقی نقطه‌چین علامت زدم که یک کلوز هفتگی بود. قیمت نتونست بالای سقف BRN کلوز کنه. سقف پایین‌تر که @ 1.2990 علامت زده شده نقطهٔ تصمیم برای ریزش بود. ممنون.\n\n…\n\nپیدا کن","m":75}],"images":[{"k":"fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe","t":"assets/thumbs/fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe.webp","f":"assets/images/fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe.webp","w":1258,"h":806,"b":42340,"o":"fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe.png","p":3,"pid":"finddecision_p3_51"},{"k":"1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1","t":"assets/thumbs/1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1.webp","f":"assets/images/1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1.webp","w":1258,"h":806,"b":41074,"o":"1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1.png","p":3,"pid":"finddecision_p3_52"},{"k":"c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5","t":"assets/thumbs/c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5.webp","f":"assets/images/c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5.webp","w":1258,"h":806,"b":53328,"o":"c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5.png","p":3,"pid":"finddecision_p3_53"},{"k":"64a2e491db2d78b02ed1ab4821a0717532325e81","t":"assets/images/64a2e491db2d78b02ed1ab4821a0717532325e81.webp","f":"assets/images/64a2e491db2d78b02ed1ab4821a0717532325e81.webp","w":60,"h":60,"b":1172,"o":"64a2e491db2d78b02ed1ab4821a0717532325e81.png",